Z||000006||Jncomutt||08-25-2001||09:20 PM||||My 84 4spd does the same exact thing.  Gets outta hand sometimes and gotta back of the throttle entirly...  It really sneaks up on ya, cruising around at 75, move your foot slightly and jumps up 15 mph.  Don't want ta run into the Po-lice doin 90.  ||||reg||1
